Graduate and Junior Geologists 
Allegro is urgently recruiting for current and upcoming jobs
Allegro is a specialist resource industry recruiter, and our HR team have extensive field experience. Contact us now for employment opportunities in mining or exploration.
We are looking for people with:
- Tertiary qualifications in Geology;
- Commitment to safety, health, environment, and technical requirements;
- A good attitude, work ethic, and willingness to learn;
- Current manual driver’s license;
- The ability to pass a Police Clearance, pre-employment medical and drug and alcohol screen;
- Australian Permanent Residents or the necessary permits to work in Australia.
Ideally you will also have:
- First Aid Certificate; 
- 4WD Certificate, or willingness to obtain one (for exploration jobs).
Our clients have a range of interesting projects in gold, base metals, and new technology minerals. They offer a variety of rosters and locations; Contract and Full-Time opportunities; Brownfield and Greenfield exploration; open pit and underground mining; and attractive pay rates.
To be considered for these opportunities with Allegro, please click the 'Apply Now' link to submit your application. For further information contact Marc Barnaby on (08) 9433 4066
